### GET request to example server
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/2

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-20",
  "phone": "123-455-0000"
}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "dateOfBirth": "1991-04-20",
  "phone": "127-495-8888",
  "email": "johndoe@email.com"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/patients/1

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments/2

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-10-27T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-10-27T09:30:00Z",
